                <div class="hero-two-content service">
                  <p data-wf-target="[[[&quot;6b03d34cb4fd67e674c0206c&quot;,&quot;65ac4f4a-1a82-f8f3-9991-4884ee86bfec&quot;],[]]]" class="font-normal">Bring the technical details, installation requirements, and ongoing care together with services built around your operation.</p>
                  <div data-wf-target="[[[&quot;6b03d34cb4fd67e674c0206c&quot;,&quot;65ac4f4a-1a82-f8f3-9991-4884ee86bfed&quot;],[]]]" class="hero-button-wrap">
                    <a href="/contact-v1" data-wf--primary-button--variant="base" data-wf-component-id="fe6f4be6-50ca-05e1-38e9-9a6e9da8d773" data-wf-variant-state="base" class="primary-button w-inline-block">
                      <div class="button-text-wrap">
                        <div class="footer-link-text is-one">Request a Quote</div>
                        <div class="footer-link-text is-two">Request a Quote</div>
                      </div>
                      <div class="button-arrow-wrap"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="100%" class="button-icon">
                          <path fill="currentColor" d="M4 11H16V13H4V11ZM14 7H16V9H14V7ZM16 9H18V11H16V9ZM18 11H20V13H18V11ZM16 13H18V15H16V13ZM14 15H16V17H14V15Z"></path>
                        </svg><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="100%" class="button-icon">
                          <path fill="currentColor" d="M4 11H16V13H4V11ZM14 7H16V9H14V7ZM16 9H18V11H16V9ZM18 11H20V13H18V11ZM16 13H18V15H16V13ZM14 15H16V17H14V15Z"></path>
                        </svg></div>
                    </a>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div data-wf-target="[[[&quot;6b03d34cb4fd67e674c0206c&quot;,&quot;65ac4f4a-1a82-f8f3-9991-4884ee86bff5&quot;],[]]]" class="page-hero-media"><img class="cover-image" src="/images/Rectangle-30.webp" width="4320" height="1944" alt="Robotic arms working on an industrial control platform" sizes="(max-width: 4320px) 100vw, 4320px" parallax="" loading="lazy" srcset="/images/Rectangle-30-p-500.webp 500w, /images/Rectangle-30-p-800.webp 800w, /images/Rectangle-30-p-1080.webp 1080w, /images/Rectangle-30-p-1600.webp 1600w, /images/Rectangle-30-p-2000.webp 2000w, /images/Rectangle-30-p-2600.webp 2600w, /images/Rectangle-30-p-3200.webp 3200w, /images/Rectangle-30.webp 4320w"></div>
      </section>
      <section class="section is-black">
        <div class="section-gap">
          <div class="container">
            <div class="split-head is-service">
              <div class="service-badge-wrap">
                <div to-top-0="" class="font-extra-small">What We Do</div>
              </div>
              <div class="split-head-body what-we-do">
                <h2 heading-rebuild="" data-wf-target="[[[&quot;6b03d34cb4fd67e674c0206c&quot;,&quot;ab3ba643-5233-25f4-1c0b-39877e59dbd5&quot;],[]]]" class="section-heading">The Right Support to Keep Work Moving.</h2>
                <p to-top-2="" class="font-regular is-split">Every industrial project requires the right combination of planning, equipment, technical expertise, and ongoing care. Explore our core services to find the support that fits your requirements.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="difference-grid-v2">
              <div to-top-0="" class="difference-card is-feature">
                <div class="difference-card-top">
                  <div class="difference-icon"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 32 32" height="32" width="32" class="card-icon">
                      <path stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor" d="M3.33301 12.6667H17.9997"></path>
                      <path stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor" d="M23.333 12.6667H28.6663"></path>
                      <path stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor" d="M12.667 28.6667V12.6667"></path>
                      <path stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor" d="M12.667 8.66659V3.33325"></path>
                      <path stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor" d="M22.6663 22.6666C19.9997 22.6666 17.333 24.8297 17.333 28.6666H13.9997C8.97135 28.6666 6.45721 28.6666 4.8951 27.1045C3.33301 25.5425 3.33301 23.0282 3.33301 17.9999V13.9999C3.33301 8.9716 3.33301 6.45745 4.8951 4.89535C6.45721 3.33325 8.97135 3.33325 13.9997 3.33325H17.9997C23.0279 3.33325 25.5422 3.33325 27.1042 4.89535C28.6663 6.45745 28.6663 8.9716 28.6663 13.9999V23.7909C28.6663 26.4837 26.4834 28.6666 23.7906 28.6666"></path>
                    </svg></div>
                  <div class="font-extra-small is-soft">01//</div>
                </div>
                <div class="difference-card-text">
                  <h3 class="font-normal is-medium">Engineering &amp; Design</h3>
                  <p class="font-regular">Turn operational requirements into practical equipment plans and technical solutions</p>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div to-top-2="" class="difference-card is-feature">
                <div class="difference-card-top">
                  <div class="difference-icon"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 32 32" height="32" width="32" class="card-icon">
                      <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor" d="M28.423 9.52177L27.7649 8.37964C27.2671 7.51587 27.0183 7.08399 26.5949 6.91176C26.1714 6.73955 25.6925 6.87544 24.7347 7.14723L23.1078 7.60549C22.4963 7.74651 21.8547 7.66651 21.2965 7.37964L20.8473 7.12048C20.3685 6.81383 20.0002 6.36169 19.7963 5.83024L19.3511 4.5004C19.0583 3.62038 18.9119 3.18036 18.5634 2.92868C18.215 2.677 17.7521 2.677 16.8262 2.677H15.3398C14.4141 2.677 13.9511 2.677 13.6026 2.92868C13.2541 3.18036 13.1078 3.62038 12.815 4.5004L12.3697 5.83024C12.1659 6.36169 11.7976 6.81383 11.3188 7.12048L10.8697 7.37964C10.3113 7.66651 9.66979 7.74651 9.05831 7.60549L7.43134 7.14723C6.47355 6.87544 5.99467 6.73955 5.57123 6.91176C5.14779 7.08399 4.89894 7.51587 4.40121 8.37964L3.7431 9.52177C3.27655 10.3314 3.04327 10.7363 3.08855 11.1672C3.13382 11.5982 3.44611 11.9455 4.07069 12.6401L5.44541 14.177C5.78141 14.6023 6.01995 15.3437 6.01995 16.0102C6.01995 16.677 5.78149 17.4181 5.44545 17.8435L4.07069 19.3805C3.44611 20.0751 3.13383 20.4223 3.08855 20.8534C3.04327 21.2843 3.27655 21.6891 3.7431 22.4987L4.40119 23.6409C4.89891 24.5046 5.14779 24.9366 5.57123 25.1087C5.99467 25.281 6.47357 25.1451 7.43137 24.8733L9.05826 24.415C9.66985 24.2739 10.3115 24.3541 10.8699 24.641L11.319 24.9002C11.7977 25.2069 12.1659 25.6589 12.3697 26.1903L12.815 27.5203C13.1078 28.4003 13.2541 28.8403 13.6026 29.0921C13.9511 29.3437 14.4141 29.3437 15.3398 29.3437H16.8262C17.7521 29.3437 18.215 29.3437 18.5634 29.0921C18.9119 28.8403 19.0583 28.4003 19.3511 27.5203L19.7965 26.1903C20.0002 25.6589 20.3683 25.2069 20.8471 24.9002L21.2962 24.641C21.8546 24.3541 22.4962 24.2739 23.1078 24.415L24.7347 24.8733C25.6925 25.1451 26.1714 25.281 26.5949 25.1087C27.0183 24.9366 27.2671 24.5046 27.7649 23.6409L28.423 22.4987C28.8895 21.6891 29.1227 21.2843 29.0775 20.8534C29.0322 20.4223 28.7199 20.0751 28.0954 19.3805L26.7206 17.8435C26.3846 17.4181 26.1461 16.677 26.1461 16.0102C26.1461 15.3437 26.3847 14.6023 26.7206 14.177L28.0954 12.6401C28.7199 11.9455 29.0322 11.5982 29.0775 11.1672C29.1227 10.7363 28.8895 10.3314 28.423 9.52177Z"></path>
                      <path stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor" d="M20.6927 15.9999C20.6927 18.5773 18.6033 20.6666 16.026 20.6666C13.4487 20.6666 11.3594 18.5773 11.3594 15.9999C11.3594 13.4226 13.4487 11.3333 16.026 11.3333C18.6033 11.3333 20.6927 13.4226 20.6927 15.9999Z"></path>
                    </svg></div>
                  <div class="font-extra-small is-soft">02//</div>
                </div>
                <div class="difference-card-text">
                  <h3 class="font-normal is-medium">Manufacturing &amp; Assembly</h3>
                  <p class="font-regular">Coordinate equipment components and assemblies around your project specifications</p>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div to-top-4="" class="difference-card is-feature">
                <div class="difference-card-top">
                  <div class="difference-icon"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 32 32" height="32" width="32" class="card-icon">
                      <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor" d="M14.6667 14.6667L8 8"></path>
                      <path stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor" d="M6.66699 10.0001L10.0003 6.66675L6.00033 4.66675L4.66699 6.00008L6.66699 10.0001Z"></path>
                      <path stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor" d="M26.6332 11.9665C27.9811 10.6185 28.3321 8.65114 27.686 6.98064L25.79 8.87664H23.1233V6.20997L25.0193 4.31397C23.3488 3.66793 21.3815 4.01888 20.0335 5.36684C18.6851 6.71529 18.3343 8.68365 18.9813 10.3546L10.3546 18.9813C8.68366 18.3343 6.71529 18.6851 5.36684 20.0335C4.01888 21.3815 3.66793 23.3488 4.31397 25.0193L6.20997 23.1233H8.87664V25.79L6.98064 27.686C8.65114 28.3321 10.6185 27.9811 11.9665 26.6332C13.3139 25.2857 13.6652 23.3193 13.0201 21.6492L21.6492 13.0201C23.3193 13.6652 25.2857 13.3139 26.6332 11.9665Z"></path>
                      <path stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor" d="M15.7295 19.3334L23.2015 26.8055C23.9052 27.5092 25.0463 27.5092 25.75 26.8055L26.8056 25.7499C27.5095 25.046 27.5095 23.9051 26.8056 23.2014L19.3336 15.7292"></path>
                    </svg></div>
                  <div class="font-extra-small is-soft">03//</div>
                </div>
                <div class="difference-card-text">
                  <h3 class="font-normal is-medium">Installation &amp; Commissioning</h3>
                  <p class="font-regular">Plan equipment installation and coordinate the transition toward operational readiness</p>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>
      <section class="section is-night-dark">
        <div class="section-gap is-large">
          <div class="container">
            <div class="page-section-head">
              <div to-top-0="" class="font-extra-small">Our Services</div>
              <h2 heading-rebuild="" data-wf-target="[[[&quot;6b03d34cb4fd67e674c0206c&quot;,&quot;b8e36292-847b-c9bd-bae2-fde5d95bcaf4&quot;],[]]]" class="section-heading">Four Services. One Coordinated Partner.</h2>
            </div>
            <div class="w-dyn-list">
              {list0.length > 0 ? (
                <div role="list" class="service-page-list w-dyn-items">
                {list0.map((item) => (
                  <div role="listitem" class="service-collection-item w-dyn-item">
                  <div class="service-page-row">
                    <div class="service-number-wrap number">
                      <div class="service-dot"></div>
                      <div class:list={["categroy-text", { "w-dyn-bind-empty": !(item.number) }]}>{item.number}</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="service-page-card">
                      <a href={serviceUrl(item)} class="service-image-block w-inline-block"><img {...img(item.mainImage, "")} width="1764" height="1576" parallax="" class:list={["service-image", { "w-dyn-bind-empty": !(item.mainImage) }]}>
                        <div class="demo">#</div>
                      </a>
                      <div class="service-content is-page">
                        <div class="service-content-top">
                          <div class="service-title-wrap">
                            <div class:list={["categroy-text is-brand", { "w-dyn-bind-empty": !(item.stage) }]}>{item.stage}</div>
                            <div class:list={["service-title", { "w-dyn-bind-empty": !(item.name) }]}>{item.name}</div>
                            <p class:list={["font-regular", { "w-dyn-bind-empty": !(item.shortDescription) }]}>{item.shortDescription}</p>
                          </div>
                          <a href={serviceUrl(item)} class="blog-button w-inline-block">
                            <div class="blog-button-item">
                              <div>Explore Service</div>
                              <div class="button-arrow"><svg fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="100%" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="arrow-icon-small">
                                  <path fill="currentColor" d="M4 11H16V13H4V11ZM14 7H16V9H14V7ZM16 9H18V11H16V9ZM18 11H20V13H18V11ZM16 13H18V15H16V13ZM14 15H16V17H14V15Z"></path>
                                </svg><svg fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="100%" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="arrow-icon-small">
                                  <path fill="currentColor" d="M4 11H16V13H4V11ZM14 7H16V9H14V7ZM16 9H18V11H16V9ZM18 11H20V13H18V11ZM16 13H18V15H16V13ZM14 15H16V17H14V15Z"></path>
                                </svg></div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="button-animated-line"></div>
                          </a>
                        </div>
                        <div class="tag-list">
                          <div class="timeline-tag">
                            <div class:list={["font-small", { "w-dyn-bind-empty": !(item.focusAreas[0]?.title) }]}>{item.focusAreas[0]?.title}</div>
                          </div>
                          <div class="timeline-tag">
                            <div class:list={["font-small", { "w-dyn-bind-empty": !(item.focusAreas[1]?.title) }]}>{item.focusAreas[1]?.title}</div>
                          </div>
                          <div class="timeline-tag">
                            <div class:list={["font-small", { "w-dyn-bind-empty": !(item.focusAreas[2]?.title) }]}>{item.focusAreas[2]?.title}</div>
                          </div>
                        </div>
                      </div>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </div>
                  ))}
              </div>
                ) : (
              <div class="w-dyn-empty">
                <div>No items found.</div>
              </div>
                )}
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>
      <section class="section is-black">
        <div class="section-gap is-large">
          <div class="container">
            <div class="process-head">
              <div class="page-section-head is-wide">
                <div to-top-0="" class="font-extra-small">Our Working Process</div>
                <h2 heading-rebuild="" data-wf-target="[[[&quot;6b03d34cb4fd67e674c0206c&quot;,&quot;b8bf08bb-2f50-205f-ea3a-b80457613a99&quot;],[]]]" class="section-heading is-large">From the First Conversation to a Clearer Solution.</h2>
              </div>
              <p to-top-2="" class="font-normal is-center">A structured process helps align your equipment requirements, technical needs, and project priorities at every stage.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="process-body">
              <div to-top-0="" class="process-media"><img class="cover-image" src="/images/Rectangle-5_1.webp" width="1860" height="2211" alt="Engineer walking through an automated factory production line" sizes="(max-width: 1860px) 100vw, 1860px" parallax="" srcset="/images/Rectangle-5_1-p-500.webp 500w, /images/Rectangle-5_1-p-800.webp 800w, /images/Rectangle-5_1-p-1080.webp 1080w, /images/Rectangle-5_1-p-1600.webp 1600w, /images/Rectangle-5_1.webp 1860w"></div>
              <div class="process-steps">
                <div to-top-2="" class="process-step">
                  <div class="process-step-text">
                    <div class="font-extra-small is-soft">Step 01</div>
                    <div class="difference-card-text">
                      <div class="font-normal is-medium">Discover Your Needs</div>
                      <div class="max-width-22">
                        <p class="font-regular">Tell us about your operation, the challenges you face, and what you need to achieve</p>
                      </div>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                  <div class="process-bullet-list">
                    <div class="process-bullet">
                      <div class="process-bullet-dot"></div>
                      <div class="font-small">Requirements Review</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="process-bullet">
                      <div class="process-bullet-dot"></div>
                      <div class="font-small">Application Assessment</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="process-bullet">
                      <div class="process-bullet-dot"></div>
                      <div class="font-small">Goal Alignment</div>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <div to-top-2="" class="process-step">
                  <div class="process-step-text">
                    <div class="font-extra-small is-soft">Step 02</div>
                    <div class="difference-card-text">
                      <div class="font-normal is-medium">Plan the Solution</div>
                      <div class="max-width-22">
                        <p class="font-regular">We assess equipment options and outline the technical requirements.</p>
                      </div>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                  <div class="process-bullet-list">
                    <div class="process-bullet">
                      <div class="process-bullet-dot"></div>
                      <div class="font-small">Equipment Selection</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="process-bullet">
                      <div class="process-bullet-dot"></div>
                      <div class="font-small">Technical Planning</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="process-bullet">
                      <div class="process-bullet-dot"></div>
                      <div class="font-small">Scope Alignment</div>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <div to-top-2="" class="process-step">
                  <div class="process-step-text">
                    <div class="font-extra-small is-soft">Step 03</div>
                    <div class="difference-card-text">
                      <div class="font-normal is-medium">Coordinate Implementation</div>
                      <div class="max-width-22">
                        <p class="font-regular">Proceed with the agreed plan for equipment delivery and installation.</p>
                      </div>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                  <div class="process-bullet-list">
                    <div class="process-bullet">
                      <div class="process-bullet-dot"></div>
                      <div class="font-small">Project Coordination</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="process-bullet">
                      <div class="process-bullet-dot"></div>
                      <div class="font-small">Installation Planning</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="process-bullet">
                      <div class="process-bullet-dot"></div>
                      <div class="font-small">Progress Communication</div>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <div to-top-2="" class="process-step">
                  <div class="process-step-text">
                    <div class="font-extra-small is-soft">Step 04</div>
                    <div class="difference-card-text">
                      <div class="font-normal is-medium">Support What Comes Next</div>
                      <div class="max-width-22">
                        <p class="font-regular">Plan ongoing equipment care and discuss future requirements as your operation evolves</p>
                      </div>
